 of Block Attention (MoBA).md\",\"basename\":\"Mixture of Block Attention (MoBA)\",\"score\":307.8924564668908,\"foundWords\":[\"block\",\"block-split\",\"block-wise\",\"blocks:\",\"blocks，每个\",\"blocks\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Block\",\"offset\":14},{\"match\":\"Block\",\"offset\":84},{\"match\":\"blocks，每个\",\"offset\":200},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":273},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":289},{\"match\":\"blocks\",\"offset\":341},{\"match\":\"Block\",\"offset\":552},{\"match\":\"Block-wise\",\"offset\":638},{\"match\":\"blocks\",\"offset\":810},{\"match\":\"Block\",\"offset\":830},{\"match\":\"ure bl\",\"offset\":1105},{\"match\":\"5: Block-\",\"offset\":1186},{\"match\":\"ent b\",\"offset\":1217},{\"match\":\": 1 b\",\"offset\":1242},{\"match\":\"ory blo\",\"offset\":1293},{\"match\":\"12 bl\",\"offset\":1304},{\"match\":\"A。核心\",\"offset\":1717},{\"match\":\"evel 优化包括：b\",\"offset\":1728},{\"match\":\"entio\",\"offset\":1806},{\"match\":\"→1M）。\",\"offset\":1950},{\"match\":\"ixtur\",\"offset\":2047}],\"excerpt\":\"## Mixture of Block Attention (MoBA)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\\nMoBA（Mixture of Block Attention）是一种将 Mixture of Experts (MoE) 的专家路由原理从 FFN 层迁移到 attention 层的稀疏注意力架构。核心思想：将长上下文的 Key-Value 序列划分为等大小的 blocks，每个 query token 通过 parameter-free gating（query 与 mean-pooled K per block 的内积）计算与每个 block 的 affinity score，再用…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/MoveCache Algorithm for Paged Block Eviction.md\",\"basename\":\"MoveCache Algorithm for Paged Block Eviction\",\"score\":301.0767459488384,\"foundWords\":[\"block\",\"block（因为每个\",\"block（b=16）为单位存储。当某些\",\"block-level\",\"blocks,\",\"blocks\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Block\",\"offset\":33},{\"match\":\"block-level\",\"offset\":127},{\"match\":\"block（b=16）为单位存储。当某些\",\"offset\":194},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":215},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":236},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":375},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":389},{\"match\":\"block（因为每个\",\"offset\