Hybrid Attention Kernel (via Block Sparse Attention) (融合混合注意力Kernel)\\n术语是什么？\\nFused Hybrid Attention Kernel 是 Elastic Attention 中用于在同一 kernel launch 中同时计算 Full Attention (FA) heads 和 Sparse Attention (SA) heads 的 GPU kernel，基于 Block Sparse Attention (BSA) Kernel（Guo et al., 2024, mit-han-lab）。与传统 Serial Dispatch（先 split tensor…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/PagedAttention with TMA Block Table.md\",\"basename\":\"PagedAttention with TMA Block Table\",\"score\":290.9274205881958,\"foundWords\":[\"block\",\"block_table\",\"block-sparse\",\"blocks\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Block\",\"offset\":27},{\"match\":\"blocks\",\"offset\":172},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":201},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":581},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":601},{\"match\":\"block_table\",\"offset\":926},{\"match\":\"block_table\",\"offset\":1076},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":1126},{\"match\":\"block_table\",\"offset\":1137},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":1157},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":1587},{\"match\":\"Block-Sparse\",\"offset\":1817},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":2042}],\"excerpt\":\"## PagedAttention with TMA Block Table\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nPagedAttention (Kwon et al., SOSP 2023) 是一种 KV cache 内存管理技术，将 KV cache 划分为固定大小的 \\\"pages\\\"（blocks），通过 page table 将逻辑 KV block 位置映射到物理 HBM 地址，消除传统 contiguous KV cache 的内存碎片问题。FlashAttention-3 的 inference 实现中（contributed by Kai Londenberg），PagedAtt…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Vector Sparsity _ Fine-Grained Block Sparsity.md\",\"basename\":\"Vector Sparsity _ Fine-Grained Block Sparsity\",\"score\":290.757353930097,\"foundWords\":[\"block\",\"block_row\",\"block-sparse\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Block\",\"offset\":34},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":118},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":134},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":173},{\"match\":\"block-sparse\",\"offset\":208},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":228},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":291},{\"match\":