ffset\":325},{\"match\":\"blockIdx.x\",\"offset\":509},{\"match\":\"Level-1:\",\"offset\":557},{\"match\":\"Level-2:\",\"offset\":900}],\"excerpt\":\"## Hybrid Tile Scheduling / Two-Level Tile Scheduling\\nHybrid Tile Scheduling（混合 tile 调度，亦称 Two-Level Tile Scheduling）是 HyTiS 的核心调度策略。核心思想：GPU GEMM 中不同 wave 有不同优化目标——full waves 硬件资源充足应最大化吞吐量，partial wave 硬件资源富余但 workload 不足应最小化延迟。因此采用两级不同 micro-kernel：Level-1 用 Throughput-Oriented (TO) large-tile micro-kernel 处理 full waves，Level-2…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Patch-Level Cache Reuse for Diffusion Serving.md\",\"basename\":\"Patch-Level Cache Reuse for Diffusion Serving\",\"score\":271.03090519518906,\"foundWords\":[\"block\",\"block→成功率更低，figure\",\"block→成功率更低\",\"blocks→per\",\"blocks集合显著不同），因此需要per-patch的动态复用决策。mixfusion在每个block每step前用random\",\"blocks集合显著不同\",\"blocks\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":9},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":79},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":152},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":201},{\"match\":\"blocks\",\"offset\":226},{\"match\":\"blocks集合显著不同），因此需要per-patch的动态复用决策。MixFusion在每个block每step前用Random\",\"offset\":276},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":561},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":613},{\"match\":\"Block\",\"offset\":783},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":981},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":1407},{\"match\":\"blocks→per\",\"offset\":1451},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":1462},{\"match\":\"blocks\",\"offset\":1494},{\"match\":\"blocks\",\"offset\":1672},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":1740},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1761},{\"match\":\"block→成功率更低，Figure\",\"offset\":1882},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":1936}],\"excerpt\":\"## Patch-Level Cache Reuse for Diffusion Serving\\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nPatch-Level Cache Reuse（patch级缓存复用）是一种在扩散模型逐step denoising过程中，以patch（而非全图）为粒度进行block输出的缓存和选择性重算的技术。核心观察是扩散模型denoising过程中相邻steps的block输出高度相似——但不同分辨率的图像在不同blocks上的相似性分布不同（Figure 7, 512/768/1024分辨率下skipped blocks集合显著不同），因此需要per-patch的动态复用决…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Driver-Level Placeholder Kernel Slots.md\",\"basename\":\"Driver-Level Placeholder Kernel Slots\",\"score\":265.13435311248895,\"foundWords\":[\"block\",\"blockdim,\",\"blockdim\",\"level\",\"level修改的具体api名称\",\"level修改直接覆盖其code\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":10},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":71},{\"match\":\"level修改直接覆盖其code\",\"offset\":324},{\"match\":\"blockDim,\",\"offset\":844},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1140},{\"match\":\"level修改的具体API名称\",\"offset\":1334}],\"excerpt\":\"## Driver-Level Placeholder Kernel Slots\\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nDriver-Level Placeholder Kernel Slots是Infera绕过CUDA driver kernel module加载限制的技术：NVIDIA GPU执行kernel前需通过cuModuleLoad将CUDA binary加载到module，该函数会触发global host-device synchronization，不适用于推理时的低延迟动态kernel发射。Infera在GPU memory中预留placeholder kernels（空壳kernel…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Two-Level Load Balancing (for SpMV on TCs).md\",\"basename\":\"Two-Level Load Balancing (for SpMV on TCs)\",\"score\":261.16377688247735,\"foundWords\":[\"block\",\"block含4\",\"block数\",\"block、medium聚合、short用sptc）；\",\"blocks分配\",\"blocks_per_warp\",\"blocks\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":7},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":59},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":165},{\"match\":\"block、Medium聚合、Short用SpTC）；\",\"offset\":287},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":323},{\"match\":\"blocks\",\"offset\":345},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":454},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":495},{\"match\":\"blocks\",\"offset\":623},{\"match\":\"blocks\",\"offset\":669},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":766},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":834},{\"match\":\"blocks分配\",\"offset\":854},{\"match\":\"block含4\",\"offset\":875},{\"match\":\"block数\",\"offset\":948},{\"match\":\"blocks\",\"offset\":966},{\"match\":\"blocks\",\"offset\":982},{\"match\":\"blocks_per_warp\",\"offset\":1004},{\"match\":\"blocks\",\"offset\":1033},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":1107},{\"match\":\"block\",\"off