e\":224.3961904579426,\"foundWords\":[\"block\",\"blocking）。iteration-level\",\"blocking\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":13},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":114},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":194},{\"match\":\"blocking）。Iteration-level\",\"offset\":288},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":541},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1490},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1600},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":1618},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1915}],\"excerpt\":\"## Iteration-Level Scheduling / Selective Batching（迭代级调度）\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nIteration-Level Scheduling 是 LLM serving 系统中的细粒度请求调度策略，由 Orca 系统首次提出。传统 serving 的 request-level batching 将不同请求 padding 到相同长度后批处理——padding token 浪费计算、已完成生成但未结束的请求需等待同批次慢请求（head-of-line blocking）。Iteration-level…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Two-Level Quantization for Attention Map.md\",\"basename\":\"Two-Level Quantization for Attention Map\",\"score\":222.88117055341297,\"foundWords\":[\"block\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":7},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":94},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":324},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":376},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":431},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":598},{\"match\":\"// L\",\"offset\":765},{\"match\":\"P̃ 后\",\"offset\":1336},{\"match\":\"NVFP\",\"offset\":1455},{\"match\":\"1×16\",\"offset\":1464}],\"excerpt\":\"## Two-Level Quantization for Attention Map\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nTwo-Level Quantization 是 SageAttention3 提出的针对 attention map P（softmax 输出，值域 [0, 1]）的专用量化策略。由于 P 的值域极窄（[0, 1]），直接做 FP4 microscaling quantization 时，scale factor 的范围仅为 [0, 0.167]，导致 scale factor 在 E4M3 FP8 格式下仅能使用 280 个（…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Two-level Sparse Storage Format (BSR + Bitmap) for Sparse MHA.md\",\"basename\":\"Two-level Sparse Storage Format (BSR + Bitmap) for Sparse MHA\",\"score\":213.78910587248166,\"foundWords\":[\"block单元；innertile\",\"block单元\",\"level\"