ty Estimation 是 Quest 的核心算法组件：利用 KV cache 每个 page 内 Key 向量的 per-channel 最小值 m_i 和最大值 M_i 作为紧凑元数据，结合当前 Query 向量 Q 计算每 page attention score 的数学上界，以此估计该 pag…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Stacked Co-location (堆叠共置).md","basename":"Stacked Co-location (堆叠共置)","score":168.4510850834194,"foundWords":["block","block就可以被调度到该sm","block_85,","block_84,","block_0,","block_0","block_1,","block_1","blocks在sm0内：","blocks在sm0内","blocks在sm内的垂直堆叠关系。在μshare的实验中，vectorized","blocks在sm内的垂直堆叠关系","blocks接近完成","blocksize，block就可以被调度到该sm。由于同一kernel的所有block有相同blocksize和资源需求，硬件scheduler自然倾向将它们填入相同的sm集合。现有系统（infless、orion、mps、mig）在inter-sm层面做spatial/temporal","blocksize","blocks，但这些blocks的hardware","blocks","level"],"matches":[{"match":"blocks","offset":113},{"match":"blocks","offset":143},{"match":"blocksize","offset":182},{"match":"blocksize","offset":231},{"match":"blocks，但这些blocks的hardware","offset":271},{"match":"blocks在SM内的垂直堆叠关系。在μShare的实验中，vectorized","offset":358},{"match":"blocksize","offset":422},{"match":"blocksize","offset":469},{"match":"blocks","offset":530},{"match":"blocks","offset":561},{"match":"block","offset":926},{"match":"block","offset":956},{"match":"block_0","offset":985},{"match":"block_1","offset":1033},{"match":"block_0,","offset":1088},{"match":"block_1,","offset":1102},{"match":"block_0","offset":1142},{"match":"block_84,","offset":1152},{"match":"block_1","offset":1167},{"match":"block_85,","offset":1177},{"match":"block","offset":1216},{"match":"blocks","offset":1238},{"match":"blocks接近完成","offset":1271},{"match":"blocks","offset":1328},{"match":"blocks在SM0内：","offset":1391},{"match":"level","offset":1740},{"match":"blocksize，block就可以被调度到该SM。由于同一kernel的所有block有相同blocksize和资源需求，硬件scheduler自然倾向将它们填入相同的SM集合。现有系统（INFless、Orion、MPS、MIG）在inter-SM层面做spatial/temporal","offset":1898},{"match":"blocksize","offset":2269}],"excerpt":"Stacked Co-location（堆叠共置）是指NVIDIA GPU硬件调度器的默认行为：当一个CUDA kernel被launch后，其多个blocks被顺序调度到SM cores，同一kernel的blocks因具有相同的资源需求而被\"堆叠\"