nsorIR → Relax)\n- 融合/优化策略 (AutoScheduler)\n- Codegen\n- 并发支持\n- Framework execution simulation\n- 注解\n\n### 方法3: Triton\n- IR 设计 (Triton IR → TTGIR)\n- Block-level model\n- Codegen → PTX\n- Autotuner\n- 并发支持\n- Framework execution simulation\n- 注解\n\n### 方法4: MLIR (Torch-MLIR/IREE)\n- Multi-dialect architecture\n- gpu/async/scf dialects\n- IREE HAL\n- Framework execution simulation\n- 注解\n\n### 方法5: PyTorch 2.0 (TorchDynamo + TorchInductor)\n- FX Graph capture\n- Inductor loop-level IR\n- Multi-kernel codegen\n- Framework execution simulation\n- 注解\n\n### 方法6: CUTLASS 3.x (CuTe DSL)\n- Collective abstraction\n- Warp specialization\n- SM90+ concurrency\n- Framework execution simulation\n- 注解\n\n### 方法7: CANN (Huawei Ascend)\n- GE/IRFusion\n- NPU compilation\n- Framework execution simulation\n- 注解\n\n### 方法对比表\n\n### 不确定性\n\n[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] Q3.4","signature":"ebbaa406-af53-4a01-b734-1c7a2999e9e0"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":56664,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":28032,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1160925f-6168-4e90-b67c-071cc165da1d","uuid":"8272a47d-4f75-4410-9c87-f22cc2a664fd"}
