{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"8755be1a-aaf0-431f-a92c-69d054436f83","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"答案文件已写入，**986 行**，远超 100 行最低要求。\n\n## 完成摘要\n\n### Q3.4 — 哪些编译框架支持 MoE/DiT/多模态/Video 多算子/微算子并发？\n\n覆盖了 **7 个编译框架**的完整 IR→融合→Codegen→并发链路，每个框架都提供了 **L3 粒度的框架执行模拟**（步骤 1..N + 伪时间线 + SM 分区 + 注解）：\n\n| # | 框架 | 核心要点 |\n|---|------|---------|\n| 1 | **XLA/GSPMD** | HLO SSA→SPMD partition→async All-to-All→Thunk executor，device 级并发 |\n| 2 | **TVM** | Relay `parallel` annotation→TensorIR `T.parallel` axis→AutoScheduler evolutionary search→multi-stream codegen |\n| 3 | **Triton** | Block-level `program_id` grid 并发→TTIR→TTGIR→PTX，Autotuner 自动搜索最优 tile |\n| 4 | **MLIR/IREE** | Multi-dialect (`async.execute`+`scf.forall`+`gpu.launch`)→progressive lowering→HAL command buffer |\n| 5 | **PyTorch 2.0** | Dynamo FX Graph→Inductor 融合+多 stream→Triton codegen→CUDA Graph replay |\n| 6 | **CUTLASS 3.x** | CuTe DSL warp specialization→TMA/wgmma→persistent tile scheduler→直接 PTX/SASS |\n| 7 | **CANN** | GE engine IRFusion→Da Vinci Cube∥Vector ILP→HCCS 多 chip 并发，编译时静态编排 |\n\n**笔记证据**: 16 条 knowledge_notes + 1 条 paper_sec，均标注 vault 路径。末尾附跨硬件并发模型对比表和方法对比表。\n\n`[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] Q3.4`"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":106793,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":28032,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1160925f-6168-4e90-b67c-071cc165da1d","uuid":"82a75d77-f079-479a-b317-b501ed1c37d8"}
